  "description": "A content-hashed build cache for .NET repositories on CI. It fingerprints every project from its own inputs and its dependencies, restores unchanged projects and their test results from a shared cache, builds and tests only what changed, and gates coverage per project. An optional service fills the cache from merged pull requests and records build telemetry.",
